{"unit_id":"yesang0924-beep__dsh-glass-skin#feature-1","repo":"yesang0924-beep/dsh-glass-skin","commit":"88732342772b82a875333c0a1d298df838640220","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Glass Skin 的界面主题：接入 DSH 主题令牌并应用玻璃材质样式，覆盖工作区、菜单和阅读区域。主题在设置页注册，随界面启动并响应明暗方案。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:3590-3688","client.js:1-30"]}
